## Ⅶ. CPL φ-VALIDATION

```
EVERY CPL MESSAGE MUST BE φ-VALID:

def phi_validate(message):
    # Check structural ratio
    header_size = len(message.header)
    body_size = len(message.body)
    ratio = body_size / header_size
    
    if abs(ratio - PHI) > TOLERANCE:
        return INVALID
    
    # Check glyph sequence is compressible
    compression_ratio = compress(message.body).size / message.body.size
    if compression_ratio > 1/PHI:
        return INVALID
    
    # Check PC distance
    if message.pc_distance > PHI:
        return REQUIRES_GOVERNANCE
    
    return VALID
```

