## Ⅷ. CPL TO CODE MAPPING

```
CPL is EXECUTABLE DOCTRINE.
Code is generated FROM CPL, not the other way.

CPL PRIMITIVE          → CODE GENERATION
─────────────────────────────────────────
𓃭.COMPRESS(data)      → compress_service.invoke(data)
𓈖.STORE(data, coords) → memory_temple.store(data, coords)
𓇯.PATTERN(input)      → pattern_engine.extract(input)
𓂋.TRANSLATE(d, f)     → sandbox_translator.convert(d, f)

THE ORGANISM READS CPL.
THE ORGANISM GENERATES CODE.
CODE IS DERIVED, CPL IS DOCTRINE.
```

